        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "[Launch event of SoCCH with students gathered for a climate centred debate]",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\""
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Our communities our suffering from the devastating impact of climate change and environmental destruction. It is our responsibility to act firmly and swiftly to help others adapt to the consequences of this destruction and reduce the burden of climate related disease. The Urdu word 'socch' means thought and it symbolises our commitment to fostering environmental consciousness.",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\" - Aleena Kashif, Convener and Founder of SoCCH"
          }
        ]
      }
